        "last_updated": "Last Updated: January 29, 2026",
        "content": "<p>This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>The Ultimate Snooze LLC</strong> (“The Ultimate Snooze,” “we,” “us,” or “our”) collects, uses, and protects your information when you use our website and services.</p><p>By accessing or using https://theultimatesnooze.com, you agree to this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, please discontinue use of our website.</p><p>Please also review our Terms of Service, which govern your use of our website.</p>",
